      "target": "Characters/Dialogue/Emily",
      "key": "married_Shane",
      "field": null,
      "source": "Well, now that you're married, I assume Shane won't be coming to the Saloon as much!#$e#That's probably a good thing, but it's always a little sad to lose a regular...$s",
