    {
      "target": "Characters/Dialogue/Emily",
      "key": "reject_866",
      "field": null,
      "source": "Oh, that's beautiful... I have a friend who would love that! But she lives far from here...",
      "translation": "Jé, to je nádherné... Mám kamarádku, které by se to moc líbilo! Žije ale daleko odsud...",
      "sourceSHA256": "ab9c399d0dd36b43fb717b9ebba0a9c7621cb37ab4b64967326c8c18f199f15f",
      "translationSHA256": "e0ba63fb4e501c816fd4fd970790af653bfd97285f4357a244f4fb3c56faadf1",
