    {
      "target": "Characters/Dialogue/Emily",
      "key": "secondChance_Girls",
      "field": null,
      "source": "@... I'm ready to give you a second chance. I still have faith that there's a good person inside of you.$s",
      "translation": "@... Jsem připravená dát ti druhou šanci. Pořád věřím v dobro, které v sobě máš.$s",
      "sourceSHA256": "8d974b78164a6cef6149a9c61a49bf5b38ac50a647b144e5c0d0dc3aa1782be4",
      "translationSHA256": "955fd04a59c4111fce18132e96c2d6c43de8d99bc3de2373fb979ecad89abe04",
      "reviewChecks": [
