    {
      "target": "Characters/Dialogue/Emily",
      "key": "Mon",
      "field": null,
      "source": "Have I told you Haley and I are sisters? Strange, isn't it?",
      "translation": "Už jsem ti řekla, že jsme s Haley sestry? Zvláštní, že?",
      "sourceSHA256": "116b3d18d59c27449ff95d042d3b68892d6519a3b8d43bd8db1a5a0609e22a64",
      "translationSHA256": "cf86183b23317d2811d845b60db2595d4324bafa3774aed4981c1886fac24080",
      "reviewChecks": [
        "sourceMeaning",
        "detailsAndTone",
        "glossary",
        "czechGrammar",
        "englishResidue",
        "characterVoice",
        "context",
        "tokensAndStructure"
      ]
    },
    {
      "target": "Characters/Dialogue/Emily",
      "key": "Mon2",
      "field": null,
      "source": "I have a secret hobby, but I won't say any more.#$e#Maybe I'll show you some day.$h",
      "translation": "Mám tajného koníčka, ale víc neprozradím.#$e#Možná ti ho někdy ukážu.$h",
      "sourceSHA256": "857bab16ee302233b9dba61f59b4cf7e1dba5c4e16bbec8bb3cf8c5f9a05d985",
      "translationSHA256": "6203f4d3c6b0919d96cb687a6c14a521a0548a202a4938b20d2e68e364094c08",
      "reviewChecks": [
        "sourceMeaning",
        "detailsAndTone",
        "glossary",
        "czechGrammar",
        "englishResidue",
        "characterVoice",
        "context",
        "tokensAndStructure"
      ]
    },
    {
      "target": "Characters/Dialogue/Emily",
      "key": "Mon4",
      "field": null,
      "source": "This world is full of spirits and magic... Some don't believe me, but I know it's true.#$e#I can see it in your eyes... you believe in the other world, like me.",
      "translation": "Tento svět je plný duchů a magie... Někteří mi nevěří, ale já vím, že je to pravda.#$e#Vidím ti to v očích... Věříš v jiný svět stejně jako já.",
      "sourceSHA256": "da198837ff647266727feec3431fb1c563431048728c1ab7ee48e665eb6333de",
      "translationSHA256": "06011b7a78d623d1096a9a50945b50e883383444f676ae7bc13b9fd4dc86f216",
      "reviewChecks": [
        "sourceMeaning",
        "detailsAndTone",
        "glossary",
        "czechGrammar",
        "englishResidue",
        "characterVoice",
        "context",
        "tokensAndStructure"
      ]
    },
    {
      "target": "Characters/Dialogue/Emily",
      "key": "Mon6",
      "field": null,
      "source": "I wish Haley would get a job or at least contribute to cooking and cleaning.$s#$e#I think she's hoping to marry someone rich.$u",
      "translation": "Kéž by si Haley našla práci nebo alespoň pomáhala s vařením a úklidem.$s#$e#Myslím, že doufá ve svatbu s někým bohatým.$u",
      "sourceSHA256": "0e5f3d77028e2648e0aeae63f6ba3dcb19e392ef9446a3e2aebc02a2cb4fd6f6",
      "translationSHA256": "0b82416f3ff61178e8c068ededb9a444ebc45ffbd8799e39b1611e30362fec4e",
      "reviewChecks": [
        "sourceMeaning",
        "detailsAndTone",
        "glossary",
        "czechGrammar",
        "englishResidue",
        "characterVoice",
        "context",
        "tokensAndStructure"
      ]
    },
    {
      "target": "Characters/Dialogue/Emily",
      "key": "Mon6_inlaw_Haley",
      "field": null,
      "source": "I have to say, now that Haley's gone I've had a much easier time keeping things in order.",
      "translation": "Musím říct, že od chvíle, kdy Haley odešla, se mi daří udržovat pořádek mnohem snáz.",
      "sourceSHA256": "13453b2f3c05cfda9af9b6f4199b06e09ccb2d27e087b9a49d4a559cee89c85a",
      "translationSHA256": "20804437cb4c85516a2dba5190366877e2178e28673fa490918daf9a81b51c26",
      "reviewChecks": [
        "sourceMeaning",
        "detailsAndTone",
        "glossary",
        "czechGrammar",
        "englishResidue",
        "characterVoice",
        "context",
